[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8291.589, "timestamp": "02:18:11", "text": "嗯，我覺得玩多了自然而然就學會了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8297.03, "timestamp": "02:18:17", "text": "好的。  嗯。  嗯，那太好了。  好的，我快速補充法術。  不過，我的意思是，起步階段往往會比較困難，所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8299.27, "timestamp": "02:18:19", "text": "不要太"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8301.75, "timestamp": "02:18:21", "text": "擔心。是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8305.669, "timestamp": "02:18:25", "text": "。還有，最近"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8308.469, "timestamp": "02:18:28", "text": "怎麼樣？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8310.309, "timestamp": "02:18:30", "text": "另外，呃，有沒有關於《龍與地下城》的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8312.629, "timestamp": "02:18:32", "text": "電影之類的作品？我聽到了。  有一部《龍與地下城》電影，但我還沒看過。我不知道裡面是什麼。  啊，原來有部電影。  好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8328.79, "timestamp": "02:18:48", "text": "我目前正在更新你的法術，例如"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 8332.341, "timestamp": "02:18:52", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i just got RickRolled by hanhan's channel"}]